==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|partīe}}, from {{der|de|fro|partie}}. Cognate with {{cog|en|party}}, {{cog|it|partita}}.<ref>{{R:Kluge 1891|Partei}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/parˈtaɪ̯/|[paʁˈtaɪ̯]|[pa(ɐ̯)ˈtaɪ̯]}}
* {{audio|de|De-Partei.ogg|Audio}}
* {{rhymes|de|aɪ̯}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|f}}

